        }
      ],
      "currentText": "林远从包里找到一支快没墨的笔，在纸袋上写了两个日期。一个是试合作结束的那天，另一个是试合作结束后的第一个周末。他们并排看着，发现第二个日期两个人都可以空出来。小夏把笔推回他手边，等他把约定记进日历。",
      "status": "fixed",
      "checkedSourceHash": null
    },
    {
      "noteId": "c46e8825-76b1-4fc1-a2c5-af4a94a50414",
      "sceneId": "scene_e919f09d3b7d45f7",
      "statementId": "stmt_ui_101",
      "range": "statement",
      "targetIndex": 10,
      "precedingDirections": [
        {
          "id": "stmt_ui_87",
          "command": "background",
          "summary": "action=set asset=sample_station transition=fade duration=300ms"
        },
        {
          "id": "stmt_ui_89",
          "command": "show",
          "summary": "action=show asset=xia_letter slot=primary z=0 position=left"
        },
        {
          "id": "stmt_ui_24",
          "command": "show",
          "summary": "action=show asset=xia_smile slot=primary z=0 position=right"
        },
        {
          "id": "stmt_ui_111",
          "command": "background",
          "summary": "action=set asset=night_cafe transition=fade duration=300ms"
        },
        {
          "id": "stmt_ui_112",
          "command": "audio",
          "summary": "action=play asset=soft_rain bus=ambient loop=true volume=0.12"
        }
      ],
      "currentText": "等待上菜时，林远把试合作的邮件打开给她看。小夏没有替他修改决定，只帮他找出一个没看清的时间：第一天需要的是线上碰面，不是必须早晨站到办公室里。他们对着这句话笑了很久，笑过以后，他给自己写下以后要把完整邮件读完的提醒。林远又给联系人发了一条消息，确认先在线上开始试合作，并把明早的车票退掉，等驻地安排确定后再买票。",
      "status": "fixed",
      "checkedSourceHash": null
    },
    {
      "noteId": "0b8fdbf7-94ce-4581-8740-282392f30ccd",
      "sceneId": "scene_9f0052a9d0d84faa",
      "statementId": "stmt_ui_148",
      "range": "statement",
      "targetIndex": 4,
      "precedingDirections": [
        {
          "id": "stmt_ui_143",
          "command": "background",
          "summary": "action=set asset=morning_studio transition=fade duration=300ms"
        },
        {
          "id": "stmt_ui_144",
          "command": "audio",
          "summary": "action=stop bus=ambient"
        },
        {
          "id": "stmt_ui_145",
          "command": "show",
          "summary": "action=hide slot=primary"
        }
      ],
      "currentText": "线上碰面比他想象中普通。新同事介绍了试合作的内容，询问他能投入多少时间，也明确说可以在第一周之后重新调整。林远第一次没有为了显得可靠，把每一个问题都回答成没问题。他认真看了日历，说出自己真正能够完成的范围。双方约好这两周先远程合作，结束后再确认到岗日期。",
      "status": "fixed",
      "checkedSourceHash": null
    },
